WEBVTT

00:09.900 --> 00:10.070
170 lag

00:58.710 --> 01:00.530
<i>It’s been three days.</i>

01:01.430 --> 01:02.220
Glen!

01:06.850 --> 01:08.550
The magnetic field is different.

01:08.550 --> 01:10.690
This isn't Myce.

01:12.100 --> 01:14.690
Why is it so hot in here?

01:14.690 --> 01:15.680
The climate control is...

01:17.550 --> 01:20.170
I guess I have to put up with this.

01:23.520 --> 01:25.730
Dammit!

01:25.730 --> 01:28.270
I can't believe this!

02:01.110 --> 02:03.220
Looks like dinnertime!

02:04.080 --> 02:06.180
How is it, Komimasa?

02:06.470 --> 02:08.130
There's tons of munchies!

02:08.130 --> 02:10.630
Look, we haven't eaten in a
while, so don't waste this chance!

02:10.630 --> 02:11.650
Okay!

02:12.070 --> 02:13.710
Kei!

02:14.610 --> 02:16.940
Hey, Kei!

02:17.790 --> 02:20.040
What's wrong with you?

02:20.040 --> 02:21.100
A shooting star!

02:21.100 --> 02:21.530
Huh?

02:32.470 --> 02:34.710
Now, here's our chance!

03:23.190 --> 03:27.260
Taowajan Resort Villas,
property for sale?

03:54.130 --> 04:01.480
<i>The night sky has betrayed the stars...</i>

04:04.400 --> 04:12.130
<i>A faraway cry slowly fades.</i>

04:15.100 --> 04:25.450
<i>The sun has disappeared...</i>

04:25.450 --> 04:36.170
<i>and my heart is alone
with the revelation.</i>

04:38.400 --> 04:46.700
<i>A stranger's dreams appear.</i>

04:49.180 --> 04:57.440
<i>Tempting lost souls.</i>

04:59.610 --> 05:07.550
<i>A stranger's dreams appear.</i>

05:05.610 --> 05:09.510
Iria: Zeiram the Animation

05:09.510 --> 05:13.200
Rampage

05:16.870 --> 05:18.330
Oh man...

05:18.330 --> 05:20.630
How far do I have to go to find fuel?

05:21.260 --> 05:23.590
I don't have time to waste here!

05:29.250 --> 05:31.140
Found a sucker!

05:38.030 --> 05:40.150
<i>You’ve reached the
administrative office of Taowajan.</i>

05:40.480 --> 05:43.370
My name is Iria, and I'm an
assistant to Hunter Glen, from Myce.

05:43.370 --> 05:45.770
I need to return to Myce. Where
is your nearest teleport gate?

05:45.770 --> 05:50.720
<i>Unfortunately, we do not have a
teleport station available at this time.</i>

05:50.720 --> 05:54.850
<i>Please make an appointment to obtain
a schedule for the next access window.</i>

05:54.850 --> 05:57.080
That was useless!

06:09.520 --> 06:11.180
So?

06:11.660 --> 06:14.820
It's a three-seater.

06:14.820 --> 06:18.850
It's beat up, so we'll only
get about 40,000 kems for it.

06:19.120 --> 06:20.900
That's a girl, right?

06:20.900 --> 06:23.480
What's with the men's hair beads?

06:24.030 --> 06:26.190
I think it looks cool.

06:26.470 --> 06:28.400
Let me see!

06:30.660 --> 06:33.140
She's a Hunter!

06:33.140 --> 06:34.240
A Hunter?

06:34.240 --> 06:36.040
— Crap!
— That sucks!

06:36.370 --> 06:39.840
The colour of her necklace means she's
still an apprentice, she won't be too tough.

06:39.840 --> 06:40.950
Right on!

06:40.950 --> 06:43.460
We'll get her. Just stick to the plan.

06:43.460 --> 06:44.690
Okay!

07:04.280 --> 07:05.270
Are you okay?

07:09.410 --> 07:12.490
Stop crying. Tell me what's wrong?

07:12.490 --> 07:14.200
Um...

07:14.200 --> 07:16.200
Yes. Go on.

07:18.620 --> 07:20.580
I gotcha!

07:21.780 --> 07:24.250
Hold on! That was too quick!

07:24.590 --> 07:26.130
You little brat!

07:27.200 --> 07:27.960
What the...

07:30.740 --> 07:32.930
We did it!

07:33.180 --> 07:35.110
Stop it!

07:35.110 --> 07:36.390
Stop!

07:36.390 --> 07:38.180
I can't believe this!

07:41.350 --> 07:45.400
Cut it out, or you'll lose
your fur and turn into lunch!

07:48.160 --> 07:49.530
Those punks!

07:56.860 --> 07:57.870
Whoa!

07:57.870 --> 07:59.280
What the hell?

07:59.280 --> 08:00.870
That's my line!

08:07.610 --> 08:09.950
Hey, are you okay?

08:11.810 --> 08:13.340
This is my emergency food!

08:14.450 --> 08:16.300
Come and get me!

08:18.420 --> 08:20.270
That's it, you'll pay!

08:28.360 --> 08:29.320
Freeze!

08:29.770 --> 08:31.430
Freeze or I'll shoot!

08:31.430 --> 08:34.320
Oh yeah? You're not that tough, you're just an apprentice.

08:34.960 --> 08:36.280
Is that so?

08:40.710 --> 08:43.410
Hey, you can't do that! You're still a rookie!

08:43.720 --> 08:45.660
Wanna bet?

08:46.130 --> 08:50.260
Hunter's code, Article 25,
Paragraph three states:

08:50.260 --> 08:56.050
If a citizen is threatened in any way,
it is permissible for a...

08:56.050 --> 09:01.220
licensed Hunter of any level
to fire upon the perpetrator.

09:07.000 --> 09:09.480
A quick little punk...

09:12.470 --> 09:16.090
You can kiss my butt!

09:16.580 --> 09:18.820
Wait you brat!

09:31.360 --> 09:32.630
I've been waiting for you.

09:33.220 --> 09:34.870
Stop fooling around!

09:34.870 --> 09:36.010
If you don't stop...

09:36.470 --> 09:37.930
No more games!

09:38.720 --> 09:40.390
Now, listen to me...

09:44.100 --> 09:47.810
See for yourself, this is just
the beginning of what I can do.

09:47.810 --> 09:49.290
What?

09:49.780 --> 09:51.770
So, do you have anything you want to say?

09:56.050 --> 09:58.160
Take this!

09:59.990 --> 10:02.080
Help!

10:09.010 --> 10:11.640
I'll be back, dammit!

10:11.640 --> 10:15.010
Hurry up, do something!

10:19.270 --> 10:21.160
What should we do?

10:21.160 --> 10:23.180
I don't know!

10:25.140 --> 10:26.600
Everyone, jump!

10:32.150 --> 10:33.500
That hurt!

10:33.500 --> 10:34.780
I'm the one that's hurt!

10:37.960 --> 10:41.410
Wow, it's soft!

10:41.410 --> 10:43.370
Is it, now?

10:44.700 --> 10:47.910
Ow, this isn't fair!

10:47.910 --> 10:48.660
What?

10:48.880 --> 10:52.730
Don't play dumb! You need to fuel up!

10:52.730 --> 10:54.630
I can't take this anymore!

10:55.910 --> 10:57.420
You're right.

10:57.420 --> 11:00.920
After I receive the reward for
turning you in, I'll fill it up.

11:00.920 --> 11:02.220
Huh?

11:03.080 --> 11:05.160
Wait! You can't be serious!

11:05.160 --> 11:08.600
So, you're a genuine
juvenile delinquent.

11:08.600 --> 11:11.020
What do you think?
I gotta survive, you know.

11:11.500 --> 11:14.120
Hmm, I see.

11:16.830 --> 11:19.700
You're not really gonna
turn me in, are you?

11:20.180 --> 11:21.660
Why would I?

11:22.370 --> 11:25.090
What's stopping you?

11:25.090 --> 11:26.680
Because I said so.

11:26.680 --> 11:28.120
Come on, don't give me that!

11:29.180 --> 11:31.580
You're all just trying
to survive, right?

11:32.480 --> 11:33.360
Yeah.

11:33.360 --> 11:34.790
That's why.

11:34.790 --> 11:36.040
I still don't get it.

11:42.690 --> 11:44.300
Is that the Administration Building?

11:44.300 --> 11:45.710
Yup.

11:46.160 --> 11:49.170
Later, kid. Thanks for giving me directions.

11:49.170 --> 11:51.010
Wait, why the hell should I thank you?

11:51.010 --> 11:52.480
You're such a creep!

11:53.110 --> 11:54.440
You're welcome to join me in there.

11:54.950 --> 11:56.760
Come on, you promised
you wouldn't, remember?

11:57.820 --> 11:59.380
Okay, beat it!

11:59.380 --> 12:02.360
I may not turn you in, but that doesn't
mean they're not gonna catch you.

12:03.580 --> 12:04.790
Okay...

12:16.120 --> 12:17.500
Huh?

12:19.360 --> 12:20.840
Please!

12:20.840 --> 12:23.170
Let me just hold you for a minute.

12:23.170 --> 12:25.690
It reminds me of home.

12:29.100 --> 12:31.730
<i>What am I doing?</i>

12:51.800 --> 12:52.870
Excuse me?

12:53.370 --> 12:54.830
Am I hearing this right?

12:55.120 --> 13:00.010
I said you can depart for Myce
immediately after you pay 150 kem.

13:00.010 --> 13:03.710
I don't have any cash! I left in a hurry!

13:03.710 --> 13:05.800
I'm sorry to hear that.

13:06.500 --> 13:10.260
Look, I'm a Hunter. I'm still a rookie, but...

13:10.790 --> 13:16.060
The law states that free transit must
be given to a hunter in the line of duty!

13:16.060 --> 13:17.490
Let's see...

13:17.490 --> 13:20.160
The ship was called the Comma?

13:20.160 --> 13:21.710
The Karma!

13:21.710 --> 13:23.490
We have no reports of an accident.

13:24.030 --> 13:25.770
That's impossible!

13:30.300 --> 13:34.040
Slum dwellers causing problems again... Damn it!

14:21.480 --> 14:23.170
We gotta take cover!

14:39.100 --> 14:40.380
Yes?

14:40.380 --> 14:41.980
<i>We have satellite confirmation.</i>

14:41.980 --> 14:44.110
<i>The object that crashed into
the Nightfall Zone is Zeiram!</i>

14:44.480 --> 14:46.080
<i>We’re absolutely positive!</i>

14:46.080 --> 14:49.570
Understood. This is perfect, monitor
the situation very closely.

14:49.570 --> 14:51.230
<i>Yes, sir.</i>

14:51.780 --> 14:53.120
Hold on!

14:53.120 --> 14:55.490
You're gonna tell them to sit back
and just monitor the situation?

14:55.490 --> 14:57.750
Those people can't handle that monster!

14:58.330 --> 15:00.760
This building has an adequate
defence against Zeiram.

15:00.760 --> 15:04.740
This area is surrounded
by emergency teleporters.

15:04.740 --> 15:07.170
We'll just send him
away at our convenience.

15:07.170 --> 15:09.110
Then what are you waiting for?

15:09.110 --> 15:11.210
We have a "trash" problem here.

15:11.210 --> 15:13.430
— Trash?
— That's right.

15:16.240 --> 15:18.890
The Nightfall Zone is
like a trash dump.

15:18.890 --> 15:20.900
They're nothing but a gigantic headache.

15:20.900 --> 15:22.850
It's full of criminals...

15:22.850 --> 15:25.590
and they're an ugly stain
on Taowajan's resort image.

15:25.590 --> 15:27.780
Nothing but worthless trash.

15:28.340 --> 15:29.690
So you're just going to abandon them?

15:29.860 --> 15:32.230
It will save us the trouble
of cleaning the place up.

15:32.230 --> 15:34.070
Either way, we would have
done it ourselves, eventually.

15:48.800 --> 15:51.850
Our crime rate should drop after this.

15:51.850 --> 15:53.980
The tourists will feel
safer travelling around.

16:07.640 --> 16:09.870
Do you think the others got away?

16:09.870 --> 16:12.590
Where would they go?

16:12.590 --> 16:15.410
It's not like the
government's gonna help us.

16:18.670 --> 16:20.330
I'm low on fuel, but...

16:20.920 --> 16:24.540
if Zeiram really crashed into
this place, then Glen might...

16:43.320 --> 16:44.940
Run!

16:51.690 --> 16:54.070
He's tearing this place apart!

16:59.970 --> 17:01.750
Sara, come on!

17:02.480 --> 17:04.710
Move it, it's not safe!

17:05.130 --> 17:06.740
Komimasa!

17:06.740 --> 17:08.670
You're slowing me down, guys!

17:13.350 --> 17:14.560
You okay?

17:14.560 --> 17:17.470
You jerk! Do you like picking on kids, you coward?

17:20.560 --> 17:23.730
You piece of crap! Get lost!

17:25.270 --> 17:28.020
— Kei, help me out!
— Yeah!

17:33.740 --> 17:36.610
Kei, good shot.

17:38.550 --> 17:40.170
Watch out!

17:43.330 --> 17:45.120
Stop!

17:47.360 --> 17:49.210
Stop it!

17:56.970 --> 17:59.180
Kei! Are you guys okay?

17:59.180 --> 18:00.720
Iria!

18:03.850 --> 18:06.250
Get the hell out of here!

18:06.250 --> 18:07.310
What about you, Iria?

18:07.860 --> 18:09.900
I am a Hunter, after all.

18:10.200 --> 18:12.360
Can you handle him? You're just a rookie...

18:13.030 --> 18:14.890
Yeah, but I'm still a Hunter!

18:18.950 --> 18:20.370
Get out of here, okay?

18:20.820 --> 18:23.990
He's hurt on his hat-thing,
I think that's his weak spot!

18:24.580 --> 18:25.870
Just go, all right?

18:26.860 --> 18:29.510
Now, you'll have to deal with me!

18:32.960 --> 18:34.810
Kei was right!

18:34.810 --> 18:36.420
What happened to all your strength, huh?

18:52.380 --> 18:54.150
Kei!

18:54.390 --> 18:57.370
That traitor!

19:17.540 --> 19:23.080
We wouldn't be in this mess if you
were destroyed along with the Karma.

19:23.080 --> 19:26.220
I need to ask you a question. Did my brother make it?

19:30.360 --> 19:33.270
You can't understand me, can you?

19:56.250 --> 19:57.460
<i>Here he comes!</i>

20:12.170 --> 20:13.820
<i>Oh no!</i>

20:26.010 --> 20:28.490
<i>Big Brother, you always
get all the fun jobs!</i>

20:28.770 --> 20:30.620
<i>I don’t know if this
will be fun, exactly.</i>

20:31.040 --> 20:33.160
<i>Iria, cover me!</i>

20:33.440 --> 20:35.220
<i>Iria!</i>

20:43.560 --> 20:45.250
Glen!

20:53.780 --> 20:55.580
<i>Iria, can you hear me?</i>

20:55.580 --> 20:56.820
I hear you!

20:56.820 --> 20:58.150
I'm fighting Zeiram right now.

20:58.520 --> 21:01.030
Don't wanna admit it,
but he's kicking my butt. Tell me what to do!

21:03.020 --> 21:05.200
Iria!

21:05.550 --> 21:06.630
Kei!

21:06.630 --> 21:08.240
<i>That’s not important!</i>

21:08.240 --> 21:09.560
What do you mean?

21:09.560 --> 21:11.650
<i>Zeiram? Did you say Zeiram?</i>

21:11.650 --> 21:13.050
Yes, I did.

21:17.480 --> 21:18.500
Oh crap!

21:23.100 --> 21:24.680
<i>Iria, are you okay?</i>

21:24.680 --> 21:25.880
So far, yeah.

21:30.540 --> 21:32.660
That was close.

21:33.250 --> 21:34.150
It's mine now!

21:34.150 --> 21:35.100
Kei!

21:35.370 --> 21:37.170
Are you hurt?

21:38.450 --> 21:40.020
I filled up your tank!

21:40.810 --> 21:41.900
Thanks.

21:41.900 --> 21:45.390
<i>Iria, there’s one chance. You have to...</i>

21:45.390 --> 21:47.030
I have to do what?

21:47.250 --> 21:50.180
Forget it, you're not helping!

22:02.310 --> 22:03.990
You're crazy!

22:03.990 --> 22:05.880
Not as crazy as you!

22:09.250 --> 22:12.330
— Where are we going?
— To the Administration Building.

22:12.330 --> 22:14.390
— What?
— I'm going to take out the trash.

22:16.270 --> 22:19.430
What? She's heading over here with Zeiram?

22:19.430 --> 22:20.500
<i>Yes, sir.</i>

22:20.500 --> 22:23.040
Shield! Raise the shield, now!

22:23.040 --> 22:24.730
We can't let Zeiram in here!

22:34.370 --> 22:36.300
Oh my God!

22:37.280 --> 22:40.380
Lower the shield and get him out! Take emergency measures!

22:50.320 --> 22:51.590
This can't be happening!

22:51.980 --> 22:53.840
Stay right here.

22:53.840 --> 22:54.560
Iria!

22:56.500 --> 22:57.940
Move it!

22:57.940 --> 22:59.480
What are you doing?

22:59.480 --> 23:02.400
Now you know how those kids feel!

23:16.010 --> 23:16.950
Glen!

23:17.240 --> 23:19.330
<i>Iria, the teleporter!</i>

23:19.330 --> 23:20.920
<i>But watch
out when you...</i>

23:21.430 --> 23:22.770
I can't hear you!

23:22.770 --> 23:25.140
The reception is awful!

23:41.640 --> 23:42.560
What the hell?

23:44.440 --> 23:45.570
Crap!

23:45.820 --> 23:47.440
Is this some kind of a joke?

24:14.970 --> 24:17.920
<i>Iria, I’m checking pod two!</i>

24:17.920 --> 24:20.400
<i>You can’t use the second pod!</i>

24:24.820 --> 24:26.860
They're a little late.

24:29.620 --> 24:31.580
I'm famished.

24:40.040 --> 24:41.510
We'll be fine.

24:41.510 --> 24:44.690
The people in the Nightfall
Zone are pretty tough.

24:44.690 --> 24:47.050
Things like this won't get to us.

24:48.070 --> 24:49.500
Hey!

24:49.780 --> 24:52.470
You gotta admit, that
was pretty cool, huh?

24:52.470 --> 24:54.620
— What was?
— We kicked butt as a team.

24:54.620 --> 24:56.740
— You and me?
— Yup.

24:56.740 --> 24:59.610
I can't let a rookie
handle everything alone.

24:59.610 --> 25:01.230
I'll watch your back from now on.

25:01.230 --> 25:06.200
Excuse me, but show some respect
when you talk to an older person.

25:07.900 --> 25:10.540
I think I'd make a great partner.

25:10.860 --> 25:13.150
Aren't you busy trying
to survive with the other kids?

25:14.920 --> 25:15.860
That's true, but...

25:16.670 --> 25:20.330
Thanks for the offer, but I already have a partner, back on Myce.

25:20.830 --> 25:22.720
I see...

25:24.140 --> 25:25.250
Kei, where did you get that?

25:25.720 --> 25:29.530
He dropped it in the
Kreper when he jumped in.

25:29.530 --> 25:31.290
He? You mean Zeiram?

25:31.290 --> 25:33.390
Yeah, that thing.

25:33.390 --> 25:34.720
It's pretty, huh?

25:38.860 --> 25:40.560
Glen!

25:43.800 --> 25:46.240
— I'll give it to you.
— What?

25:46.240 --> 25:48.480
It's a parting gift.

25:57.610 --> 25:59.970
How could he have this?

25:59.970 --> 26:03.170
I thought that was Glen's voice...

26:10.090 --> 26:11.960
Wait, when he hugged me...

26:17.100 --> 26:18.570
Damn it, Kei!

26:18.570 --> 26:20.430
That was my favourite!

26:26.390 --> 26:31.360
I had to get something as
my own parting gift.

26:33.510 --> 26:34.320
Damn it!

26:34.860 --> 26:37.800
I can't believe this!

26:43.400 --> 26:48.650
<i>The morning to come
does not matter...</i>

26:48.650 --> 26:56.290
<i>let's go as we are now.</i>

27:01.880 --> 27:08.290
<i>We're passing a blue star...</i>

27:08.290 --> 27:14.350
<i>a tiny floating light.</i>

27:14.350 --> 27:20.800
<i>It's just the two
of us, no need to speak.</i>

27:20.800 --> 27:26.600
<i>Looking out over the city...</i>

27:26.600 --> 27:32.850
<i>The painful memories we have shared...</i>

27:32.850 --> 27:38.120
<i>they will be put to rest tonight.</i>

27:38.120 --> 27:44.690
<i>And the night to come
does not matter...</i>

27:44.690 --> 27:51.870
<i>let's go without looking back.</i>

27:51.870 --> 27:57.140
<i>Even though our dreams are far away...</i>

27:57.140 --> 28:04.690
<i>I will never let them go.</i>

28:17.920 --> 28:22.970
Iria returns to Myce
after wandering in space.

28:24.180 --> 28:26.190
A voice calls out to her.

28:26.190 --> 28:28.310
Assassins are waiting to kill her...

28:28.720 --> 28:30.620
The piece of a falling star...

28:31.460 --> 28:33.440
People have been vanishing...

28:33.890 --> 28:35.900
And the incident has been erased...

28:36.830 --> 28:41.320
Iria, brimming with rage, searches
for the truth within the darkness...

28:41.520 --> 28:43.580
You didn't save Bob, did you?

28:43.570 --> 28:47.330
Vestige.
